        "Description": "An urgent contract has been issued. Stealing from Kronstadt isn&apos;t the only thing SLICK has been planning. ICA envoys have sent word that the heads are attempting to purchase unknown documents from the organization known as Providence. Curiously, only four of them were seen arriving by boat. These are their identities:\r\r1) Adam Jones [alias Ryan Hunter]\r2) Brady Athmer [alias Jason Portman]\r3) Robert Sweet [alias Marek Sinclair]\r4) Casey Williams [alias Godfrey Hagen]\r\rRetrieve those documents.",
